Conflicts: appimage-installer
Replaces: appimage-installer
Description: safe AppImage installer for Mainuan
 Qt Widgets interface that inspects AppImage (type 2) files without running
 them and installs them through a Debian package transaction. The
 inspection runs as an unprivileged user; a PolicyKit-authorized helper
 builds a package with a fixed file list (the AppImage under
 /opt/mainuan-appimages, a launcher and icons) and installs it with dpkg.
 .
 The interface is translated and follows the language of the KDE Plasma
 session.
